  "bio": "Gary Johnson is an award-winning tattoo artist based in Gloucester, United Kingdom, renowned for his expertise in the 'newschool' style of inking. With his passion for all things nerdy, he infuses a unique and vibrant energy into every piece he creates. Known for maintaining an exceptionally high standard of cleanliness, Gary ensures a safe and hygienic environment for every client who walks into his studio, BLACKLETTER - DRUNKMONKEY.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Gloucester, England, United Kingdom\n\nTattooer at @blacklettertattoo\nMultiple Award winning +10 years\n📍Gloucester, UK\nFather and Lover of all things nerdy!",
